== crate::impls::Point::fmt
EventEntry — when a Point is formatted as text ({} in println!, format!, to_string)
Return — return write!(f, "({}, {})", self.x, self.y)
== crate::impls::Point::length
Entry — when length() is called
Return — return (self.x * self.x + self.y * self.y).sqrt()
